cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or data, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Code and data for: Testing quantum memories on IBM hardware"
abstract: >-
  Code, hardware records and analysis of a project testing how well IBM's
  calibration data predict the errors of heavy-hex subsystem-code memories at
  distances 3 and 5: fifteen jobs over five days on IBM Fez, with predictions
  stored before each job, and a follow-up on IBM Kingston with a reset-free
  circuit, lifetime measurements and a raw-readout control.
authors:
  - given-names: Nadav
    family-names: Abramson
    affiliation: "Independent researcher"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/GoofyGgoober/heavyhex-subsystem-code"
url: "https://github.com/GoofyGgoober/heavyhex-subsystem-code"
keywords:
  - quantum error correction
  - heavy-hex
  - subsystem code
  - IBM Fez
  - calibration-based prediction
